&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Assist in identifying, analyzing, and documenting business processes for automation opportunities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Participate in discovery projects to evaluate current workflows and recommend areas for improvement&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support the design, development, and deployment of automated solutions using tools such as RPA (Robotic Process Automation), workflow platforms, and scripting languages&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
