&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3167&quot; data-end=&quot;3541&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3167&quot; data-end=&quot;3236&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3169&quot; data-end=&quot;3236&quot;&gt;Direct impact on a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3188&quot; data-end=&quot;3204&quot;&gt;hyper-growth&lt;/strong&gt; part of Cloudflare’s business&lt;/p&gt;
