&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal AI Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Become a power user and internal champion for our proprietary tools helping the team leverage these platforms for smarter decision-making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
