&lt;p&gt;This role needs to communicate effectively across multiple departments, have the ability to shift gears at a moment&#39;s notice, and provide air cover for their team while advocating internally for their interests/needs. All of this with the main purpose of maintaining strong sales performance, meeting budget expectations and targets. The Enterprise Sales Manager role will report to the Country Leader.&lt;/p&gt;
