&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloudflare ANZ is investing in a focused&amp;nbsp;Digital Native channel strategy, and we are hiring a Partner Account Manager to build and scale this motion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional channel management role.&amp;nbsp;This is a strategic, builder-focused position responsible for recruiting, developing, and scaling a small number (3–5) of high-impact cloud-native and DevOps-focused partners who serve Digital Native customers across markets including, but not limited to (SaaS, fintech, e-commerce, marketplaces, AI startups, scale-ups).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role reports to the&amp;nbsp;Director of ANZ Partner Sales&amp;nbsp;and works in close partnership with Cloudflare’s&amp;nbsp;Sales Director (ANZ)&amp;nbsp;and the Digital Native Account Executive team. Success in this role requires tight co-sell alignment, shared pipeline accountability, and strong cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will operate as a business builder, creating a scalable partner ecosystem that positions Cloudflare as the connectivity and security platform of choice for high-growth cloud-native companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel will be required across ANZ to support partner recruitment, enablement, customer meetings, executive alignment, and strategic governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital Native companies are among the fastest-growing and most security-conscious segments in ANZ. They demand modern, developer-friendly, scalable platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is central to embedding Cloudflare within cloud-native architecture decisions, driving revenue in close alignment with the ANZ Sales Director and Digital Native Account Executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will directly shape the ANZ Digital Native partner ecosystem and build a durable, scalable co-sell engine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Build the Digital Native Partner Ecosystem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, recruit, and onboard a limited number of strategic cloud-native consulting and security partners across ANZ who have experience and a successful track record&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Target partners with strong AWS, Azure, or GCP practices and DevOps transformation capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop joint business plans aligned to Cloudflare’s Digital Native go-to-market strategy and regional sales priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Revenue Through Strategic Co-Sell&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in lockstep with the Sales Director (ANZ) and Digital Native Account Executives to drive partner-sourced and partner-influenced revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerate regional revenue through partner-led and co-sell initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed Cloudflare into cloud migration, Zero Trust, API security, and DevSecOps transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create repeatable partner plays aligned to Digital Native customer pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct joint account planning and territory mapping with AEs and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Develop Partner Capability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with Sales Engineering and Partner Enablement to certify partner engineers and build solution capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop robust partner practice capabilities, including certification targets, packaged offerings, and joint solution messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Cloudflare as a strategic platform within partner cloud and security transformation portfolios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Executive Engagement &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong executive relationships with partner leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Quarterly Business Reviews (QBRs) with partners aligned to ANZ revenue goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular updates to the Director of ANZ Partner Sales and Sales Director on pipeline, performance, and ecosystem growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Alignment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with ANZ Sales Leadership, Digital Native AEs, Sales Engineering, Marketing, and Hyperscaler teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align partner strategy with cloud marketplace and co-sell motions where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistent pipeline hygiene, account ownership clarity, and deal registration governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable skills, knowledge and experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8–12+ years in partner sales, ecosystem strategy, or cloud channel leadership rolesProven experience recruiting and scaling strategic partners from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cloud-native, security, or SaaS environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of AWS, Azure, or GCP ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to DevOps, Kubernetes, Zero Trust, or API security preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quota-carrying or revenue-responsible experience highly desirable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builder mindset — comfortable operating in ambiguity and creating structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence — able to engage partner CEOs, practice leads, and sales directors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative leader — thrives in a highly matrixed, co-sell environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically fluent — able to speak credibly with CTOs and engineering leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially sharp — understands incentive alignment, services leverage, and partner economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial — excited to build a focused, high-growth Digital Native channel motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
