&lt;p&gt;Compensation may be adjusted depending on work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For Bay Area based hires: Estimated annual salary of $338,000 - $465,000.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
