p;quot;:0},&amp;quot;11&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;12&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;14&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0},&amp;quot;15&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;\&amp;quot;Helvetica Neue\&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;16&amp;quot;:10}&quot;&gt;Basic understanding of computer networking and “how the internet works”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
